{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44922","headline":"送杜司马再游蜀中 · 无可","name":"送杜司马再游蜀中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲客应非愿，愁成欲别时。\n还游蜀国去，不惜杜陵期。\n剑水啼猨在，关林转栈迟。\n日光低峡口，雨势出蛾眉。\n山迥逢残角，云开识远夷。\n勿令双鬓发，并向锦城衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}